  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed front porch, by reason of its overall scale, height, bulk and design, including the loss of the existing staggered front building line, would form an incongruous addition that fails to respect the character of the host dwelling. The development would be detrimental to the appearance of the property, the street scene, and the wider Hillside, Northwood Hills Area of Special Local Character. The proposal is therefore contrary to Policies BE1 and HE1 of the Hillingdon Local Plan: Part One - Strategic Policies (November 2012); Policies DMHB 1, DMHB 5, DMHB 11, DMHB 12 and DMHD 1 of the Hillingdon Local Plan: Part Two - Development Management Policies (January 2020); and Policy HC1 of the London Plan (March 2021)."
